OL,3,GNEWSABlood bike donated in teen's
OL,4,Amemory helps save lives
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe parents of a Stalybridge teenager
OL,7,Fwho died while waiting for a liver
OL,8,Ftransplant said a blood bike donated in
OL,9,Fher memory has helped save lives.
OL,11,FMaisie Almond was 14 when she died of
OL,12,Fliver failure in 2024, two weeks after
OL,13,Ffirst complaining of a stomach ache.
OL,15,FDespite being matched with a donor, she
OL,16,Fbecame too ill for a transplant to go
OL,17,Fahead.
OL,19,FHer family have since set up Maisie
OL,20,FMoo's Missions in her memory and raised
OL,21,Fenough money to donate a motorbike to
OL,22,FGreater Manchester Blood Bikes.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
